OL,3,GNEWSADeath of boy hit by bus an
OL,4,Aaccident, inquest finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe brother of a four-year-old boy
OL,7,Finvolved in a fatal collision with a
OL,8,Fbus at a Kent hospital screamed for the
OL,9,Fvehicle to stop as his younger sibling
OL,10,Fran towards it, an inquest has heard.
OL,12,FZaahir Jan died when he was struck
OL,13,Foutside the Queen Elizabeth The Queen
OL,14,FMother Hospital in Margate on 7 August,
OL,15,F2025.
OL,17,FThe bus driver said in a witness
OL,18,Fstatement that, after pulling away from
OL,19,Fa pedestrian crossing, she heard "a
OL,20,Fyoung voice screaming 'stop'". She then
OL,21,F"felt a bump with the bus" and believed
OL,22,Fshe had "run something over".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
